.PP
dictionary of the form {c1 list c2 list c3 list} with capacitive part of equivalent elements impedance\&.
With vector output, dictionary values are RBC vector names instead of lists\&.
.PP
.RS -4n
\fBdeemb\fR (::rfutil)
.RE
.PP
Procedure for deembedding of DUT from test fixture\&.
.RS 4n
\fBdeemb\fP \fIsMeas sFixtL sFixtR ?options?\fP
.br
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters\fR
.RS 4n
.TP
-ifexists error|replace
Collision policy\&. Replacement requires a writable vector of the same type\&.
