-names dictionary
Result field to destination name mapping\&. Missing fields use #auto\&.
.TP
-namespace name
Output namespace, created if missing; relative to the caller\&.
.TP
-output list|vector
Output format; defaults to ::rfutil::configure -output\&.
.TP
sFixtL
S-parameters matrix of left fixture in dictionary form {11 list 12 list 21 list 22 list}
.TP
sFixtR
S-parameters matrix of right fixture in dictionary form {11 list 12 list 21 list 22 list}
.TP
sMeas
Measured s-parameters matrix in dictionary form {11 list 12 list 21 list 22 list}
.RE
.PP
\fBDescription\fR
.PP
.RS 4n
.nf
   ┌      ┐   ┌        ┐-1   ┌       ┐     ┌        ┐-1
   │ Tdut │ = │ Tfixtl │  x  │ Tmeas │  x  │ Tfixtr │
   └      ┘   └        ┘     └       ┘     └        ┘
.fi
.RE
.PP
Vector names resolve in the caller's namespace\&. Vector options require Tcl 9 and rbc::vector\&.
Inputs are borrowed; output vectors are owned by the caller\&. See the package guide for naming and ownership\&.
.PP
\fBReturn value\fR
.PP
dictionary of the same form as input dictionaries with deembedded DUT s-matrix\&.  With vector output,
dictionary values are RBC vector names instead of lists\&.
.PP
