.RS -4n
\fBs2t\fR (::rfutil)
.RE
.PP
Converts 2-port s-parameters to transfer parameters\&.
.RS 4n
\fBs2t\fP \fIsxx ?options?\fP
.br
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters\fR
.RS 4n
.TP
-ifexists error|replace
Collision policy\&. Replacement requires a writable vector of the same type\&.
.TP
-input list|vector
Input format; defaults to ::rfutil::configure -input\&.
.TP
-name name
Single destination for mag or angle; conflicts with the result entry of -names\&.
.TP
-names dictionary
Result field to destination name mapping\&. Missing fields use #auto\&.
.TP
-namespace name
Output namespace, created if missing; relative to the caller\&.
.TP
-output list|vector
Output format; defaults to ::rfutil::configure -output\&.
.TP
sxx
Dictionary that contains 2-port matrix of s-parameters, each matrix element is the list of values at different frequencies (or other parameter) in form of {real imag}\&. The form of dictionary is: {11 list 12 list 21 list 22 list}
.RE
.PP
\fBDescription\fR
.PP
Vector names resolve in the caller's namespace\&. Vector options require Tcl 9 and rbc::vector\&.
Inputs are borrowed; output vectors are owned by the caller\&. See the package guide for naming and ownership\&.
.PP
\fBReturn value\fR
.PP
dictionary of the same form as input dictionary with transfer parameters\&.  With vector output, dictionary
values are RBC vector names instead of lists\&.
.PP
.RS -4n
\fBs2y\fR (::rfutil)
.RE
.PP
Converts 2-port s-parameters to y-parameters\&.
.RS 4n
\fBs2y\fP \fIsxx ?z0? ?options?\fP
.br
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters\fR
.RS 4n
.TP
-ifexists error|replace
Collision policy\&. Replacement requires a writable vector of the same type\&.
.TP
-input list|vector
Input format; defaults to ::rfutil::configure -input\&.
.TP
-name name
Single destination for mag or angle; conflicts with the result entry of -names\&.
.TP
-names dictionary
Result field to destination name mapping\&. Missing fields use #auto\&.
.TP
-namespace name
Output namespace, created if missing; relative to the caller\&.
.TP
-output list|vector
Output format; defaults to ::rfutil::configure -output\&.
.TP
sxx
Dictionary that contains 2-port matrix of s-parameters, each matrix element is the list of values at different frequencies (or other parameter) in form of {real imag}\&. The form of dictionary is: {11 list 12 list 21 list 22 list}
.TP
z0
Reference impedance in form of {real imag}, default is {50 0}, optional\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBDescription\fR
.PP
Vector names resolve in the caller's namespace\&. Vector options require Tcl 9 and rbc::vector\&.
Inputs are borrowed; output vectors are owned by the caller\&. See the package guide for naming and ownership\&.
.PP
\fBReturn value\fR
.PP
dictionary of the same form as input dictionary with y-parameters\&.  With vector output, dictionary values
are RBC vector names instead of lists\&.
.PP
