.RS -4n
\fByPEq\fR (::rfutil)
.RE
.PP
Calculates equivalent P circuit elements values\&.
.RS 4n
\fByPEq\fP \fIyxx ?options?\fP
.br
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters\fR
.RS 4n
.TP
-ifexists error|replace
Collision policy\&. Replacement requires a writable vector of the same type\&.
.TP
-input list|vector
Input format; defaults to ::rfutil::configure -input\&.
.TP
-name name
Single destination for mag or angle; conflicts with the result entry of -names\&.
.TP
-names dictionary
Result field to destination name mapping\&. Missing fields use #auto\&.
.TP
-namespace name
Output namespace, created if missing; relative to the caller\&.
.TP
-output list|vector
Output format; defaults to ::rfutil::configure -output\&.
.TP
yxx
Dictionary that contains 2-port matrix of y-parameters, each matrix element is the list of values at different frequencies (or other parameter) in form of {real imag}\&. The form of dictionary is: {11 list 12 list 21 list 22 list}
.RE
.PP
\fBDescription\fR
.PP
.RS 4n
.nf
                 Y3
                 ___
     o-----o----|___|----o-----o
     \&.     |             |     \&.
     \&.    \&.-\&.           \&.-\&.    \&.
  P1 \&.    | |           | |    \&. P2
     \&.  Y1| |         Y2| |    \&.
     \&.    '-'           '-'    \&.
    \\\&./    |             |    \\\&./
     o-----o-------------o-----o
.fi
.RE
.PP
Vector names resolve in the caller's namespace\&. Vector options require Tcl 9 and rbc::vector\&.
Inputs are borrowed; output vectors are owned by the caller\&. See the package guide for naming and ownership\&.
.PP
\fBReturn value\fR
.PP
dictionary of the form {y1 list y2 list y3 list} with impedances of equivalent elements\&.  With vector
output, dictionary values are RBC vector names instead of lists\&.
.PP
